<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MAIC Holdings EPS view up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MAIC Holdings EPS view up.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Everen Securities said Wednesday it raised its earnings estimates for MAIC Holdings Inc to $3.45 a share from $3.40 for 1997 and to $3.90 from $3.80 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- The rating remains outperform.</p>
<p>-- MAIC recently reported first quarter earnings ahead of expectations of $0.81 a share, up from $0.69 a share a ago.</p>
<p>-- MAIC shares were up 3/4 at 35-3/8.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
